# Council's Judgment votes; it does not target, so hexproof does not matter (CR 115.1, 701.38a). Bot2's only nonland permanent is a
# Sylvan Caryatid (hexproof): the single candidate takes every vote, nobody is asked, and it is exiled. Bot2's Forest is a land and
# Bot1's own Mox Pearl is a permanent Bot1 controls, so neither could be voted for.

